<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Brodland (2002) / Krieg et al. (2008) / Maître et al. (2012) Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) and zebrafish germ-layer cortical tension sorting — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements Brodland's (2002) J. Biomech. Eng. Eq. (1) DITH interfacial tension law (`compute_dith_tensions`, L97-145), Maître et al.'s (2012) Science Eq. (1) Young-Dupré cell-doublet contact angle and normalized contact radius law (`compute_young_dupre_doublet`, L148-190), and Krieg et al.'s (2008) Nature Cell Biology zebrafish germ-layer sorting hierarchy across all 4 perturbation regimes (`simulate_dith_regime`, L284-472) plus 3-germ-layer concentric stratification (`simulate_three_germ_layer_sorting`, L475-574: `r_E = 0.870 > r_M = 0.663 > r_N = 0.446`). Backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) in `Loop_044_differential_interfacial_tension_sorting.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
