<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-brodland-differential-interfacial-tension-sorting-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Brodland (2002) / Krieg et al. (2008) / Maître et al. (2012) Differential Interfacial Tension Hypothesis (DITH) and zebrafish germ-layer cortical tension sorting — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes 8 quantitative morphometrics in `measure_morphoeval()` (L931-1000), including exact DITH heterotypic interfacial tension (`gamma_EM = 30.0 pN/um`), AFM cortical tension difference (`beta_M - beta_E = 45.0 pN/um`), wild-type radial core-shell separation (`Δr = +0.3807`), `caMLCK` cortical stiffening sorting reversal (`Δr = -0.3282`), Blebbistatin null separation (`|Δr| = 0.0000`), 3-germ-layer concentric stratification gap (`r_E - r_N = +0.4245`), Young-Dupré contact radius at half tension (`r_c/R = 0.8660` vs empirical doublet `0.9717`), and 12-annulus radial profile correlation (`r = 0.9301, RMSE = 0.1844`)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
