    dct:description "Simulates all 4 canonical DITH / Krieg et al. (2008) regimes plus 3-germ-layer sorting (Panels A1-A5), executes a 7-point continuous sweep across ectodermal cortical tension `beta_E in {25, 50, 72, 95, 115, 130, 145} pN/um` crossing the sorting inversion point `beta_E = beta_M = 95 pN/um` (Panel B2, L577-617) and a 6-point Young-Dupré contact angle curve across `gamma_cc/(2*gamma_cm) in [0.15, 1.00]` (Panel B3, L178-190), and exposes full CLI flags (`--beta-E`, `--beta-M`, `--beta-N`, `--gamma-EM`, `--Vt`, `--lam`, `--T`, `--mcs`, `--seed`, L1068-1108)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
